ころがあり、しっかり者の兄をいつも心配させている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人もそんな自分の抜けたところは自覚しているが、その分 兄に甘えられるので直すつもりはないらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兄・康司のことは心から頼りにしているし、大事にも思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その天真爛漫さが兄をやきもきさせているのには気づいていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お兄ちゃんの寝顔見てると眠くなるんだよなぁ。 おじゃましまーす」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23402"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"23402","value":"お兄ちゃん"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"75 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2377","sourceWorkId":"19666","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2377","sourceWorkId":"19666","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2377","sourceWorkId":"19666","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2377","sourceWorkId":"19666","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/580fcfd2d77eaec1b080833d56bacde90ab6816b0fc737cb3ce1a2fe2fdbec78.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/244ef650d2b5f7c00e54edd9b34c8e014f58664cb3c63a674d5ecb042934b5f1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あさみほとり","creatorId":"vndb:s902","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s902","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s902","name":"あさみ ほとり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:84495:23402:11646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16942","characterName":"美汐 瑛莉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"23403","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"84495"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2378"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16942"},"originalCharacterName":"美汐 瑛莉"